            "name": "Hannah Feeney",
            "position": "Social Media & Content Manager",
            "info": "Hannah Feeney is our Social Media and Content Manager and has built her career around creativity, marketing, and communication. With experience across marketing, e-commerce, and content creation for brands in health, technology, and retail, she has developed expertise in social media strategy, content design, and campaign optimisation. At Study Active, Hannah manages all digital communications, ensuring the brand’s voice is professional, engaging, and informative. Outside of work, she is passionate about fitness and enjoys training for endurance events, including HYROX and half marathons."
          }
        },
        "member_WR3JVa": {
          "type": "member",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Headshot_6.jpg",
            "name": "Heather Walker",
            "position": "Senior Tutor and Assessor",
            "info": "Heather Walker is a tutor and assessor at Study Active and has been with the organisation since 2021. Fitness and movement have always been a central part of her life, from dance and gymnastics in her early years to aerial arts and pole fitness, where she has represented Great Britain three times in the World Pole Sport Championships. She holds a variety of instructor qualifications across personal training, dance, gymnastics, aerial arts, pole fitness, and bungee fitness, and owns her own aerial arts studio. Heather brings her extensive experience and passion for movement to every learner she supports."
