            "position": "Careers Advisor",
            "info": "Jessica brings experience in coaching, fitness instruction and sales to her role as Careers Adviser. With a strong passion for supporting individuals to achieve their goals, she draws on her background as a coach and instructor to motivate and mentor learners. At Study Active, Jessica provides guidance and encouragement to help learners build confidence, make informed choices and take the next steps towards their careers in the fitness industry."
