            "info": "Kelly O’Regan has been with Study Active as a tutor and assessor since May 2023. Prior to this, she worked as a leisure club supervisor, personal trainer, and ran her own one-to-one swimming instruction business. Kelly enjoys walking, running, and maintaining a hybrid training regime, while also dedicating valuable time to her family. She is passionate about promoting and educating others on the benefits of leading a healthy lifestyle and the positive impact it can have both physically and mentally."
